{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODEyNDYz","is_bot":false,"login":"hachej","name":"Julien Hurault"},"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"f990c42f4905b1d34a17773706a2034f2464f518","body":"## Root causes and mechanisms\n\n- **Mobile/tablet hard-gate nondeterminism:** screenshot capture and DOM hard-gate collection could observe different animation/layout frames. The harness now freezes CSS motion, waits for fonts plus two animation frames, and keeps that freeze active across both screenshot and hard-gate collection before cleaning it up.\n- **Terminal empty agent roster:** the app client performs one-shot agent discovery; a rejected initial discovery cannot recover by waiting longer. Sidebar readiness now spends an initial bounded wait, reloads once, then retries readiness so discovery/hydration gets one clean restart.\n- **Pointer-model mismatch:** compact width and coarse-pointer capability are separate signals. Registered Playwright mobile capture opts into touch explicitly. Bombadil cannot emulate pointer capability, and its CI browser may report a coarse pointer even at desktop width, so the touch-target property was removed from Bombadil rather than inferred from the host browser. The command-palette hard-gate contract/spec revision is bumped accordingly.\n- **Bombadil replay divergence:** opening app navigation reveals the compact `Search⌘K` trigger asynchronously. The action policy now emits one settle `Wait` after the navigation-open click before allowing the revealed trigger, keeping generated and replayed action sets aligned.\n\n## App-fix dependency\n\nThe deterministic harness correctly exposed the genuine 20px `Archived` control on coarse-pointer sidebar states. That app defect was fixed and merged to `main` by #1430 (closing #1429); this branch is based on that merge. No app code is changed here.\n\n## Proof\n\n- `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools test` — 95/95 passed.\n- `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools typecheck` — passed with no errors.\n- Exact consecutive review command: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools ui:review -- review workspace-agent-sidebar --critic=fixture`\n  - Run 1: PASS — 1 passed (1.1m)\n  - Run 2: PASS — 1 passed (1.1m)\n  - Run 3: PASS — 1 passed (1.2m)\n  - Run 4: PASS — 1 passed (1.7m)\n  - Run 5: PASS — 1 passed (1.1m)\n  - Result: **5/5 consecutive green**\n- Thermonuclear maintainability review: clean; no material findings.\n- GitHub CI run `33101687058`: all required checks passed, including UI Review.\n\nFixes #1390\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSLWWUs8AAAABRHRQSg","author":{"login":"hachej"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Proof of work\n\nFinal head: `65f32725057e5583a064c8807b352087eda15bd8`\n\n- Capture stability freezes motion and keeps screenshot + DOM gates on one settled frame.\n- Sidebar readiness performs one bounded discovery reload before its final retry.\n- Playwright explicitly models touch with `hasTouch`; Bombadil no longer infers pointer capability.\n- Bombadil inserts one settle action after opening app navigation so generated and replayed action sets agree.\n\nValidation:\n\n- `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools test` — 95/95 PASS.\n- `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools typecheck` — PASS.\n- `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-review-tools ui:review -- review workspace-agent-sidebar --critic=fixture` — 5/5 consecutive PASS on the final runtime tree (1.1m, 1.1m, 1.2m, 1.7m, 1.1m).\n- GitHub CI run `33101687058` — PASS, including UI Review.\n- Independent thermonuclear review — clean after follow-up findings were closed and re-reviewed.\n\nThe PR remains open and unmerged for owner validation.\n","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:22:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/hachej/boring-ui/pull/1431#issuecomment-5443440714","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-08-27T13:45:26Z","authors":[{"email":"julien.hurault@sumeo.io","id":