Retest 2026-08-27 on origin/main (50edc75a9), clean worktree, 3 back-to-back runs of the issue's exact command: 0/3 passed.

- Run 1: the original symptom — ensureAgentNavigation timeout at spec.ts:37 (tree count never reaches 2, 'Open app navigation' never appears).
- Runs 2–3: got PAST navigation, then failed UI_REVIEW_HARD_GATES_FAILED on the same 11 mobile/tablet capture states (agent-list, expanded-sessions, pinned-chat, session-row-hover, agent-card-menu, agent-details).

So the #1406 replay-selection fix did not resolve this spec: the original nav timeout still reproduces intermittently, and a mobile/tablet hard-gate nondeterminism now dominates. Failure mode has broadened — treat both signatures as in-scope for this issue. Repro worktree left at .worktrees/retest-1390.
--
