Third independent sighting of the mobile/tablet hard-gate nondeterminism: the UI Review gate fails on PRs #1423 and #1424 (unrelated ui-kit one-liners) with different violation IDs per run, this time on workspace-command-palette mobile states. Combined with the 2026-08-27 retest (2/3 runs failing hard-gates on workspace-agent-sidebar mobile/tablet states), the mobile hard-gate flake is now the dominant signature of this issue and is blocking unrelated PRs. Raising priority accordingly.
